# Committed GENERATED artifacts — never prettier-formatted (their generators own the
# byte-exact form; reformatting poisons drift checks that regen + `git diff --exit-code`).
# Build outputs (dist/, storybook-static/, …) need no entries here: Prettier 3 respects
# .gitignore by default.
pnpm-lock.yaml
products/*/api/openapi.json
products/*/api-client/src/
# Supabase CLI runtime artifacts. Git-ignored via the CLI-generated NESTED
# products/*/supabase/.gitignore — but Prettier only reads the ROOT .gitignore/
# .prettierignore, so nested git ignores don't reach it; list them here explicitly.
products/*/supabase/.temp/
products/*/supabase/.branches/
# Machine-local Claude Code settings. Git-ignores it via the user's GLOBAL excludes file
# (~/.config/git/ignore) — and "Prettier respects .gitignore" means the ROOT one only, so
# a globally-ignored file still reaches Prettier and turns `format:check` red on a clean
# tree. Same class of gap as the nested supabase ignores above.
.claude/settings.local.json
